Hi Ben,

Following our conversation, I'm sending you a list of RDP tests=2E

OneDrive, SharePoint, Google Drive, Dropbox:

  *   Download a single file
  *   Download many files one by one
  *   Download a folder (will be zipped)
  *   Download many files (as a zip)
  *   Download many folders (as a zip)
  *   Download a password-protected file
  *   Download a file that will be blocked (by policy, infected)
  *   Download a file opened for view
  *   Download a currently processing file again

Outlook web, Gmail:

  *   Download a single attachment
  *   Download multiple attachments (will be zipped)
  *   Download an email
  *   Download an email with conversation
  *   Download a file opened for view
  *   Download a currently processing file again

Each action should be performed more than one time=2E



Best regards,
Sasha

